        "In the next chapter, we will show how to formulate estimators for $\\sigma^2_{\\hat{\\beta}_1}$ and $\\sigma^2_{\\hat{\\beta}_0}$ given in @thm-thm11.1. We will also show how to use these estimators to conduct hypothesis tests and construct confidence intervals for the parameters $\\beta_0$ and $\\beta_1$.\n"
      ],
